{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119071","id":3598570179,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7WfdLD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119071","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119071.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119071.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119071","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119071/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119071/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119071/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a749ebf48fa502319a46b9204fa95be99feb82c9","number":119071,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GLTF: Use p_state parameter directly","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The existing glTF code contained this:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1300\" height=\"1120\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-04-28 at 2 03 42 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c947f49-5573-4247-8ab3-6b0e65e64207\" />\r\n\r\nWith the old code, the top part would copy `p_state` into a new `state` variable. In normal cases, when a valid GLTFState is passed in, this would be fine, but useless.\r\n\r\nThen, that top code would \"handle\" it being null by instantiating `state`. This is useless, because it means the glTF data will be imported into a temporary object that disappears as soon as the function ends.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, it didn't use `state` consistently: `p_state` was used at the bottom. So it would fail anyway.\r\n\r\nThe correct behavior is: Check for `p_state` being null immediately at the start of the function. Don't copy or instantiate.\r\n\r\nBonus: I made the `Error` code consistently `ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER` instead of being `FAILED` in a few places.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_